<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<!--
★ v0.5.0 — UX 设计单页 HTML 模板（瑞士国际主义 · IKB 克莱因蓝）
Generated by /ux-project:onepage alongside ux-onepage.md
Self-contained: inline CSS, Mermaid via CDN. Print-friendly.

视觉系统来源：vendored 自 op7418/guizang-ppt-skill (MIT)
完整归属见 .claude-plugin/vendor/guizang-ppt-skill/ATTRIBUTION.md

设计原则（rule 22 保留）：
- 这是给 stakeholder 看的版本，不是 audit trail。引用 / 阶段时间戳 / 流程标签全部不显示。
- 完整 cite 留在 ux-onepage.md 里。HTML 只是清爽展示。
- 每段语言尽量短：能 12 个字别用 20 个字。

视觉纪律（rule 25 新增 · IKB Swiss）：
- 单一锚点色：IKB 克莱因蓝 #002FA7，整页实色块不超过 3 处
- 字重对比：ExtraLight 200 巨字 / Light 300 正文 / SemiBold 600 kicker
- 直角，无圆角无阴影无渐变；Hairline 1px 是手术刀
- 左对齐 + 大幅留白做非对称美学

Placeholders to fill (unchanged from v0.4)：
  {{PROJECT_NAME}}                  e.g., "alternate-routing"
  {{GOAL_STATEMENT}}                一句话目标（短）
  {{PROBLEM_FRAMING}}               1–2 句话现状+真正要解决的事（短）
  {{PRIMARY_USER}}                  短标签
  {{SECONDARY_USERS}}               逗号分隔短标签
  {{BASELINE_BULLETS_HTML}}         <li>content</li> 系列（不带 sup ref）
  {{SCENARIO_ROWS_HTML}}            <tr>...</tr> 系列（无 ref 列）
  {{NOT_DOING_BULLETS_HTML}}        <li><b>S<n>:name</b> — reason</li> 系列
  {{JTBD_CARDS_HTML}}               <div class="jtbd-card">...</div> 系列
  {{IA_TREE_HTML}}                  嵌套 <ul><li>name <span class="purpose">— purpose</span></li></ul>
  {{IA_COVERAGE_HTML}}              <li>需求 N → 路径</li> 系列
  {{MERMAID_FLOW_SRC}}              raw mermaid source（preserve indentation）
  {{FLOW_COVERAGE_HTML}}            <li>需求 N → 路径</li> 系列
  {{CONSTRAINTS_BULLETS_HTML}}      <li>...</li> 系列（短）
  {{ASSUMPTIONS_BULLETS_HTML}}      <li>...</li> 系列（短）
  {{OPEN_QUESTIONS_HTML}}           <li>...</li> 系列（短）

NOT included (rule 22 一致)：
- header meta (PRD version / date / regen count)
- phase strip (background-cleared / requirements-converged / structure-ready badges)
- section sub-tag (phase-tag spans inside h2)
- section lede paragraphs
- citation footnotes section
- <sup class="ref"> markers in body
-->
<title>UX 设计单页 — {{PROJECT_NAME}}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@200;300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    /* IKB Swiss tokens — 详见 vendor/guizang-ppt-skill/references/themes-swiss.ikb-only.md */
    --paper: #fafaf8;
    --paper-rgb: 250,250,248;
    --ink: #0a0a0a;
    --ink-rgb: 10,10,10;
    --grey-1: #f0f0ee;
    --grey-2: #d4d4d2;
    --grey-3: #737373;
    --accent: #002FA7;
    --accent-rgb: 0,47,167;
    --accent-on: #ffffff;

    /* 决策语义色（保留 stakeholder 直觉，但克制） */
    --decision-keep: var(--accent);
    --decision-cut: var(--grey-3);

    /* Stale warn — 不是 IKB，warn ≠ accent */
    --warn-bg: #fff4d6;
    --warn-border: #d4a017;

    /* 字体栈 */
    --sans: "Inter", "Noto Sans SC", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    --mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    font-feature-settings: "ss01", "cv11", "tnum";
  }

  .page {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
  }

  /* ============ Hero header ============ */
  .doc-header {
    margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
  }
  .doc-header .kicker {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8em;
  }
  .doc-header .kicker::before {
    content: "";
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .doc-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6.4vw, 88px);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 32px);
  }
  .doc-header .hero-rule {
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ============ Section ============ */
  section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 32px);
  }
  section > .sec-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  section > .sec-body { min-width: 0; }
  section h2 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* ============ §1 Goal block — IKB 左侧粗 rule ============ */
  .goal-block {
    border-left: 6px solid var(--accent);
    padding: clamp(8px, 1.2vw, 14px) 0 clamp(8px, 1.2vw, 14px) clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 28px);
  }
  .goal-block .statement {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .goal-block .framing {
    margin-top: clamp(10px, 1.4vw, 16px);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .user-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .user-chip {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
    color: var(--grey-3);
  }
  .user-chip.primary {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ============ §2 Baseline ============ */
  .baseline-list {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: baseline;
  }
  .baseline-list li {
    counter-increment: baseline;
    position: relative;
    padding: 10px 0 10px 36px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-1);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .baseline-list li::before {
    content: counter(baseline, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--grey-3);
  }
  .baseline-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ============ §3 Scenarios — Swiss table ============ */
  table.scenario-map {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  table.scenario-map th,
  table.scenario-map td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-1);
  }
  table.scenario-map thead th {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  table.scenario-map tbody tr:hover { background: var(--grey-1); }
  table.scenario-map td.decision-keep {
    color: var(--decision-keep);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  table.scenario-map td.decision-cut {
    color: var(--decision-cut);
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  table.scenario-map .lens-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
    color: var(--grey-3);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ============ §4 Not Doing ============ */
  .not-doing ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .not-doing li {
    padding: 10px 0 10px 18px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--grey-2);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .not-doing li b {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  /* ============ §5 JTBD cards ============ */
  .jtbd-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--grey-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
  }
  .jtbd-card {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 16px 18px 18px;
  }
  .jtbd-card .id {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .jtbd-card .text {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .jtbd-card .text b { font-weight: 600; }
  .jtbd-card .priority {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
    color: var(--grey-3);
  }
  .jtbd-card.primary .priority {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-on);
  }
  .jtbd-card.anti {
    background: var(--grey-1);
  }
  .jtbd-card.anti .text {
    color: var(--grey-3);
  }
  .jtbd-card.anti .id::after {
    content: " · ANTI";
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ============ §6 IA tree ============ */
  .ia-tree-wrap {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px) clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 32px);
    background: var(--grey-1);
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 20px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--grey-2);
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap > ul {
    border-left: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2px 0 2px 16px;
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap li::before {
    content: "─";
    position: absolute;
    left: -2px;
    top: 2px;
    color: var(--grey-2);
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap > ul > li {
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap > ul > li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--accent);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
  }
  .ia-tree-wrap .purpose {
    color: var(--grey-3);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .ia-coverage { margin-top: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px); }
  .ia-coverage ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .ia-coverage li {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-1);
  }
  .ia-coverage li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ============ §7 Flow ============ */
  .mermaid-wrap {
    padding: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    background: var(--grey-1);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .mermaid {
    background: transparent !important;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .flow-coverage { margin-top: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px); }
  .flow-coverage ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .flow-coverage li {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--grey-3);
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-1);
  }
  .flow-coverage li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ============ §8 Supporting ============ */
  .supporting {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
  }
  .supporting + .supporting { margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); }
  .supporting .col ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .supporting .col li {
    padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-1);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .supporting .col li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .supporting .col.open-q li::before {
    content: "?";
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .supporting code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    background: var(--grey-1);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ============ Iteration awareness (v0.4.3) — IKB 一致 ============ */
  /* 新增 → IKB 高亮；改造 → 黑色加粗；已有 → 灰 */
  .ia-new, .change-new {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ia-mod, .change-mod {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ia-existing, .change-existing {
    color: var(--grey-3);
  }
  .change-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }
  .change-tag.change-new { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .change-tag.change-existing { border-color: var(--grey-2); }

  /* ============ Stale banner — warn ≠ accent ============ */
  .stale-banner {
    background: var(--warn-bg);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--warn-border);
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6a4d05;
  }

  /* ============ Print ============ */
  @media print {
    .page { padding: 16px; max-width: none; }
    section { page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .jtbd-grid, .scenario-map, .ia-tree-wrap, .mermaid-wrap { page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .doc-header h1 { font-size: 36px; }
  }

  /* ============ Mobile fallback ============ */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    section > .sec-num { padding-top: 0; }
    .supporting { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="doc-header">
    <!-- {{STALE_BANNER_HTML}} - 仅 stale 时插入 -->
    <div class="kicker">UX ONEPAGE · {{PROJECT_NAME}}</div>
    <h1>{{PROJECT_NAME}}</h1>
    <div class="hero-rule"></div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">01</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>我们要解决什么</h2>
      <div class="goal-block">
        <div class="statement">{{GOAL_STATEMENT}}</div>
        <div class="framing">{{PROBLEM_FRAMING}}</div>
        <div class="user-row">
          <span class="user-chip primary">主要用户：{{PRIMARY_USER}}</span>
          <span class="user-chip">还会影响：{{SECONDARY_USERS}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">02</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>线上现状</h2>
      <ul class="baseline-list">
        {{BASELINE_BULLETS_HTML}}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">03</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>用户场景与取舍</h2>
      <table class="scenario-map">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>#</th>
            <th>场景</th>
            <th>视角</th>
            <th>价值</th>
            <th>成本</th>
            <th>核心度</th>
            <th>做不做</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{SCENARIO_ROWS_HTML}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">04</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>明确不做</h2>
      <div class="not-doing">
        <ul>
          {{NOT_DOING_BULLETS_HTML}}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">05</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>用户真正想完成的事</h2>
      <div class="jtbd-grid">
        {{JTBD_CARDS_HTML}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">06</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>信息架构</h2>
      <div class="ia-tree-wrap">
        {{IA_TREE_HTML}}
      </div>
      <div class="ia-coverage">
        <h3>需求 → 位置</h3>
        <ul>
          {{IA_COVERAGE_HTML}}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">07</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>交互流程</h2>
      <div class="mermaid-wrap">
        <pre class="mermaid">
{{MERMAID_FLOW_SRC}}
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-coverage">
        <h3>需求 → 路径</h3>
        <ul>
          {{FLOW_COVERAGE_HTML}}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-num">08</div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>额外信息</h2>
      <div class="supporting">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>硬约束</h3>
          <ul>{{CONSTRAINTS_BULLETS_HTML}}</ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <h3>当前假设</h3>
          <ul>{{ASSUMPTIONS_BULLETS_HTML}}</ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="supporting">
        <div class="col open-q">
          <h3>待回答</h3>
          <ul>{{OPEN_QUESTIONS_HTML}}</ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <h3>下一步</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>高保真 UI / Figma：交给 <code>huashu-design</code> / <code>frontend-design</code> / Figma</li>
            <li>下游需考虑：默认 / 空 / 加载 / 成功 / 失败 / 无权限 / 边界</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10/dist/mermaid.min.js"></script>
<script>
  if (window.mermaid) {
    mermaid.initialize({
      startOnLoad: true,
      theme: "base",
      themeVariables: {
        fontFamily: "JetBrains Mono, ui-monospace, monospace",
        fontSize: "13px",
        primaryColor: "#fafaf8",
        primaryBorderColor: "#0a0a0a",
        primaryTextColor: "#0a0a0a",
        lineColor: "#0a0a0a",
        secondaryColor: "#f0f0ee",
        tertiaryColor: "#fafaf8",
        clusterBkg: "#f0f0ee",
        clusterBorder: "#d4d4d2",
        edgeLabelBackground: "#fafaf8"
      },
      flowchart: { curve: "linear", padding: 16, htmlLabels: true }
    });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
